<title>BELGIUM: EU processed food export refunds one-day rate set.</title>
<headline>EU processed food export refunds one-day rate set.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee on Thursday approved a Commission decision to set a one-day rate for processed food export refunds to stop speculative trading, an EU official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Commission told the committee that a reduction in the gap between world market and EU prices had not been fully reflected in recent open market tender awards,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>It was decided to fix new export refunds for February on a comparison between EU and world market prices and in order to stop speculative trading new, lower, refund rates would apply for January 31.</p>
<p>The new rates for January 31 only are -</p>
<p>CEREALS</p>
<p>		     processed	  compound	 non-annex</p>
<p>		     products	   feed	     II goods</p>
<p> common wheat    5.39 ecus/t	5.39 ecus/t    5.39 ecus/t</p>
<p> durum		 0		  -		  0</p>
<p> barley	    20.97 ecus/t     20.97 ecus/t   20.97 ecus/t</p>
<p> maize	     34.96 ecus/t     34.96 ecus/t   34.96 ecus/t</p>
<p> oats		23.72 ecus/t     -		  23.72 ecus/t</p>
<p> rye		 31.32 ecus/t     -		  31.32 ecus/t</p>
<p> rice broken     22.69 ecus/t     -		  22.69 ecus/t</p>
<p> round	     250.00 ecus/t    -		  250.00 ecus/t</p>
<p> long grain	250.00 ecus/t    -		  250.00 ecus/t</p>
<p>abated refunds</p>
<p> potato starch   34.96 ecus/t     -		  34.96 ecus/t</p>
<p>glucose and glucose</p>
<p> products	  27.57 ecus/t     -		  25.57 ecus/t</p>
<p>The refunds for February are -</p>
<p>CEREALS</p>
<p>		     processed	 compound	  non-annex</p>
<p>		     products	  feed		II goods</p>
<p> common wheat    6.49 ecus/t     6.49 ecus/t     6.49 ecus/t</p>
<p> durum		 0		  -		  0</p>
<p> barley	    22.07 ecus/t    22.07 ecus/t    22.07 ecus/t</p>
<p> maize	     33.06 ecus/t    33.06 ecus/t    33.06 ecus/t</p>
<p> oats		24.82 ecus/t     -		  24.82 ecus/t</p>
<p> rye		 32.42 ecus/t     -		  32.42 ecus/t</p>
<p> rice broken     24.50 ecus/t     -		   24.50 ecus/t</p>
<p> round	     250.00 ecus/t    -		  250.00 ecus/t</p>
<p> long grain	250.00 ecus/t    -		  250.00 ecus/t</p>
<p>abated refunds</p>
<p> potato starch   36.06 ecus/t     -		   36.06 ecus/t</p>
<p>glucose and glucose</p>
<p> products	  28.67 ecus/t     -		   28.67 ecus/t</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
